    Input);       /// In one of its inputs. C: R_BLOCK_INPUT

  /// A notification's urgency (`R_NOTIFICATION_*`).
  UIUrgency = choices(
    Low = 1264,  /// No sound; may only go to the list of notifications. C: R_NOTIFICATION_LOW
    Normal,      /// Normal urgency. C: R_NOTIFICATION_NORMAL
    Critical);   /// Stays until the user dismisses it, where the system allows it. C: R_NOTIFICATION_CRITICAL

  /// A file dialog option (`R_FILE_DIALOG_*`).
